  "title": "My Mom’s Good Old Potato Salad",
  "description": "The secrets to my Mom’s tangy, good old potato salad recipe are eggs and sweet pickles. You can use dressing instead of mayonnaise for a change of pace.",
  "authors": [
    "Andrea Parker"
  ],
  "date_published": "2015-12-05T02:00:15-05:00",
